        { "q": "Solve $\\log_2(x+3)+\\log_2(x-1)=5$.", "answer": "$\\log_2[(x+3)(x-1)]=5\\Rightarrow(x+3)(x-1)=32\\Rightarrow x^2+2x-35=0\\Rightarrow(x+7)(x-5)=0$. Reject $x=-7$ (makes $x-1<0$); $x=5$." }
